#
# The readout was fitted only to fitness quantiles, mean local fitness SD and near-floor mass. At inherited r = 0.5/shared-stop, the objective improves **0.0694 → 0.0392**, mostly through the quantile term. This does not imply improvement in the unfitted graph and epistasis descriptors in Figures 1–3. The no-noise objective is worse with the profile at every tested strength.
